  "description": "The meme format relies on the implicit knowledge that different countries have distinct culinary traditions and cultural practices. The humor comes from contrasting the American tradition of a large, whole roasted turkey with the Romanian tradition of a more modern, plated dish. This is a common meme structure used to highlight cultural differences in a humorous way.",
